Cell["\<\
The sp block has orbital order {s, px, py, pz} and dimension 4. The spd block \
appends five d orbitals and has dimension 9.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1029830421,ExpressionUUID->"d6809439-3d9e-c14d-9839-31b459fe4052"],

Cell["\<\
The d-orbital order used by the companion hopping implementation is {dxy, \
dyz, dzx, dx2-y2, d3z2-r2}. Every orbital within a shell receives the same \
supplied onsite energy.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->113436079,ExpressionUUID->"4bf9f67f-6530-3644-9a81-f4b01f50c80f"],

Cell["\<\
These blocks contain orbital energies only. Add spin degrees of freedom and \
spin-orbit coupling separately when required.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->836677865,ExpressionUUID->"5e1262da-430e-5d49-987d-40a8f42ca0e0"]
}, Closed]],

